(text "Discharge: CELL_P -> Q7/Q8 -> PROTECTED_RAW -> Q13 -> VBAT" (at 25.4 184.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 45e28383-7eea-5494-b06f-c8dba96c4e56))
(text "U10 RESET_N low turns Q12 on; Q13 gate rises to raw CELL_P and blocks discharge.\nStatic trip window 3.0535..3.1465 V; recovery approximately 3.3 V. Verify dip response on a cell simulator.\nQ13 body diode points VBAT -> PROTECTED_RAW, permitting recovery charging while discharge is off.\nQ13 MUST be downstream of Q7/Q8: lifting Q7 source could exceed its gate-source rating at startup.\nU7 BAT/VDD still monitor raw cell; PACK and R41 connect to PROTECTED_RAW before Q13.\nBQ24074 and independent cell-mounted TH1 window still control charging; U7 protection stays in series.\nU7 cold-start/charger-wake compatibility remains a separate fabrication blocker. This is not a storage disconnect." (at 25.4 215.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 53a23b50-3e49-5ab5-ae20-8773df6dd3f5))
